  "name": "January, together",
  "start": "2027-01-09",
  "end": "2027-01-23",
  "countries": 1,
  "lede": "Os lands in Salvador on 28 December for New Year with friends. Around the 9th we meet somewhere new to both of us, and the two weeks after that are ours: a city to walk, some nature and animals, and dry weather. Seven options, none decided, in order of how welcoming each is likely to be.",
  "blurb": "Two weeks of us from around 9 January, somewhere new and dry, ranked by how welcoming each place is for Jabari. Bahia first, then Colombia.",
  "description": "Two weeks together in January 2027, still undecided: Bahia, Colombia, Costa Rica, Uruguay, Panama, Buenos Aires or Chile, and how each treats Black travellers.",
  "places": ["Bahia", "Colombia", "Costa Rica", "Uruguay"],
  "notes": ["Rough dates", "Not decided"],
